OL,4,CBoy, 7, pulled alive from rubble hours 
OL,5,Cafter Russian strike in Ukraine,       
OL,6,Crescuers say                           
OL,7,GA seven-year-old boy has been rescued  
OL,8,Gfrom the rubble of a residential       
OL,9,Gbuilding near Kyiv 14 hours after a    
OL,10,GRussian strike, Ukraine's state        
OL,11,Gemergency service in the capital       
OL,12,Gregion has said.                       
OL,14,FThe attack early on Sunday morning in  
OL,15,Fthe village of Dymer killed six        
OL,16,Fpeople, Kyiv's regional head Tymur     
OL,17,FTkachenko said. Six people were        
OL,18,Finjured, while others are still        
OL,19,Fmissing.                               
